 taste. But if this is the path you've chosen, I'll accept it and take my leave.",8,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg2_985","a","002",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["se","se_252"],["say","0","There's something I never told you. While I spent every day longing for your arrival, I feared it just as much.",8,""],["w",0.5],["bg","story_main_06_006",0,0.0],["w",0.3],["cbg",0,null,null,1.03,"InOutSine",3.0,null,null,null],["w",0.2],["say","0","Even if granted an audience, was I ever worthy of your salvation? Could I ever earn your approval? It's embarrassing to admit, but despite my bravado, I have no real talent. I know I lack the capability to stand by your side.",8,""],["w",1.0],["say","0","Even after all my research, I knew deep down that these soulless plants—no matter how strong they seemed—weren't the power you sought.",8,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg2_985","d","009",null,null,-1.97,4.0,null,null,"Linear",0.0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_noise",0,0],["se","se_226"],["w",1.5],["fx",0,"fx_avg_noise",1,0],["ctl","avg2_985","a","003",null,null,-0.3,1.4,null,null,"Linear",0.0],["w",0.5],["say","0","Perhaps this sounds like an excuse, the bitter rambling of a loser. But in the end, I simply wasn't worth saving. That's all there is to it.",8,""],["w",0.5],["bg","story_main_05_012",0,0.0],["cbg",0,null,500.0,1.8,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["fx",0,"fx_avg_noise",0,0],["ctl","avg2_985","a","003",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.0],["se","se_226"],["w",1.5],["fx",0,"fx_avg_noise",1,0],["w",0.5],["say","0","If, on the day you reclaim your throne, you remember that a soul once offered you everything—that my devotion never wavered despite my fate—then my life was not in vain.",8,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg2_985","a","008",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","0","To wither away holding that belief... There is no happier end for me.",8,""],["w",0.5],["say","0","The Dorra in this safe came from selling my family's estate. It's clean money, and my way of cutting ties with a past I'd rather forget. Please, use it freely.",8,""],["w",0.5],["stg",0,null,-50.0,1.1,"InOutSine",3.5,null,null,null],["trn",0,1,false,false,0.5],["w",0.5],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",1,2],["se","se_227"],["trn",1,1,false,false,1.0],["ctl","avg2_985","c","007",null,null,-0.31,null,0.9,null,"OutQuint",0.0],["w",0.5],["say","0","It may seem like a pittance when the world eventually turns against you, but being able to help, even in this small way, is my greatest honor.",8,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg2_985","c","007",null,null,-1.97,4.0,1.0,null,"Linear",0.0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_noise",0,0],["se","se_226"],["w",1.0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_noise",1,0],["ctl","avg2_985","c","007",null,null,-0.31,1.4,0.9,null,"Linear",0.0],["w",0.5],["say","0","I wish I could hear back from you, though I know that's wishful thinking.",8,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg2_985","c",null,null,null,-0.28,1.35,0.0,null,"InOutSine",5.0],["say","0","Your Loyal Servant, Darcia",8,""],["bgm",""],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,false,false,1.0],["w",1.0],["se","se_187"],["w",0.5],["say","0","35 days ago. The day Firenze finalized plans with Petal Bloom and the New Star Guild to launch the assassination.",8,""],["w",1],["clear",1,0,1],["se","se_009"],["se","se_187_stop"],["w",1.0],["bg","uniseed_basement_night",0,0.0],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",0,0],["stg",0,null,null,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["show","avg2_985","a","003",0.32,null,null,0,null,null],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",1,0],["show","avg1_110","c","017",0.75,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_110","c",null,null,0.68,null,null,1.0,null,"OutQuad",1.5],["bgm","m70"],["trn",1,0,false,false,1.0],["w",2.0],["stg",0,null,null,1.1,"OutQuint",1.0,null,null,null],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg2_985","a","002","attention",null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","avg2_985","Welcome back, Firenze.",0,""],["ctl","avg1_110","c","009",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",1.0],["se","se_062"],["say","avg1_110","Lady Darcia. Field recon is complete. I h